<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <actionCalls>
        <name>Generate_Email</name>
        <label>첫 접촉 메일 초안 생성 (프롬프트 템플릿)</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <actionName>Meeting_Prep_Email_Draft</actionName>
        <actionType>generatePromptResponse</actionType>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Email_Screen</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Assign_Prompt_Fault</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>Input:RelatedLead</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Lead</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>Meeting_Prep_Email_Draft</nameSegment>
        <outputParameters>
            <assignToReference>varEmailText</assignToReference>
            <name>promptResponse</name>
        </outputParameters>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_Prompt_Fault</name>
        <label>프롬프트 오류 메시지 담기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>varErrorMessage</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>메일 초안을 생성하지 못했습니다 (프롬프트 템플릿 Meeting_Prep_Email_Draft): </stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>varErrorMessage</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Flow.FaultMessage</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Error_Screen</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <description>Lead 상세의 &quot;첫 접촉 메일 초안&quot; 버튼. 기업 브리핑 맥락(재무·시그널)과 추천 상품 카탈로그를 grounding 하는 프롬프트 템플릿 Meeting_Prep_Email_Draft 으로 첫 접촉 이메일 초안을 생성해 화면에 표시한다. RM 이 검토·복사해 발송하는 초안 제공(읽기 전용, 레코드 변경 없음).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fEmailHtml</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>SUBSTITUTE({!varEmailText}, &quot;\n&quot;, &quot;&lt;br/&gt;&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Lead: 첫 접촉 메일 초안 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Lead: 첫 접촉 메일 초안</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Lead</name>
        <label>Lead 조회</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Generate_Email</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Lead</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <screens>
        <name>Email_Screen</name>
        <label>첫 접촉 메일 초안</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>Email_Intro</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;받는 기업: &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Lead.Company}&lt;/b&gt; — {!Get_Lead.Name} ({!Get_Lead.Title})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;아래 메일 초안은 AI(프롬프트 템플릿)가 기업 브리핑 맥락과 추천 상품을 근거로 작성했습니다. 내용을 확인·수정한 뒤 복사해 발송하세요.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>Email_Output</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;{!fEmailHtml}&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>Error_Screen</name>
        <label>오류</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>Error_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;❌ 메일 초안을 생성하지 못했습니다.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!varErrorMessage}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;관리자에게 위 메시지를 전달해 주세요.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <start>
